OL,3,GNEWSA'An unlit bonfire to a hedgehog is
OL,4,Aa five-star hotel'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife charity has urged people to
OL,7,Fcheck for hedgehogs before lighting
OL,8,Fbonfires.
OL,10,FCath Novis, trustee of Holderness
OL,11,FHedgehog Hospital, which is based in
OL,12,FBurton Pidsea in East Yorkshire, said
OL,13,Fthe structures - crammed with leaves
OL,14,Fand twigs - are mistaken for ideal
OL,15,Fnesting spots.
OL,17,FShe said: "A bonfire to a hedgehog is a
OL,18,Ffive-star hotel. It's like moving into
OL,19,Fthe Hilton for them. There's all the
OL,20,Fcreepy crawlies in there as well so
OL,21,Fthey've got a McDonald's on tap.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
