OL,3,GNEWSA'An unlit bonfire to a hedgehog is
OL,4,Aa five-star hotel'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We do sometimes get the fire brigade
OL,7,Fcontacting us to say that they've been
OL,8,Fcalled out because a hedgehog has been
OL,9,Fcaught in a fire."
